1
00:01:57,280 --> 00:01:58,239
It's me, Xiao Zhuang.

2
00:02:00,040 --> 00:02:01,519
I'm with Ma Jingrong right now.

3
00:02:04,560 --> 00:02:05,879
Do what you have to do.

4
00:02:08,159 --> 00:02:08,680
Understood.

5
00:02:22,719 --> 00:02:24,840
You didn't do as I asked.

6
00:02:27,639 --> 00:02:30,319
Mr. Theerade told me to kill you both.

7
00:02:36,520 --> 00:02:37,879
Say that again.

8
00:02:40,879 --> 00:02:44,800
Long Zhiyuan has allied with Theerade.

9
00:02:45,319 --> 00:02:48,240
He demands Theerade pay for Xiang Nan.

10
00:02:49,560 --> 00:02:51,599
You two have been betrayed.

11
00:03:00,800 --> 00:03:02,159
Why should we trust you?

12
00:03:03,759 --> 00:03:04,439
Where's the proof?

13
00:03:11,520 --> 00:03:12,960
Ma Jingrong and Qin Mu,

14
00:03:13,840 --> 00:03:14,639
to you,

15
00:03:15,599 --> 00:03:17,080
aren't really your own men.

16
00:03:17,639 --> 00:03:19,120
How much they're worth to you,

17
00:03:20,080 --> 00:03:21,360
you know better than anyone.

18
00:03:22,479 --> 00:03:24,080
Hand the two of them over to me,

19
00:03:24,719 --> 00:03:29,199
and my men will never cross you.

20
00:03:29,879 --> 00:03:33,360
Wouldn't that keep the peace?

21
00:03:35,240 --> 00:03:35,719
All right.

22
00:03:36,800 --> 00:03:37,919
Then these two lives...

23
00:03:38,360 --> 00:03:40,800
will be a welcome gift for Mr. Long.

24
00:03:47,439 --> 00:03:48,039
Despicable.

25
00:03:50,039 --> 00:03:51,520
Everything that happened today...

26
00:03:52,000 --> 00:03:53,680
...was orchestrated by you all along.

27
00:04:09,680 --> 00:04:10,400
Zhuang Cen

28
00:04:20,720 --> 00:04:21,480
Zhuang Cen

29
00:04:34,160 --> 00:04:34,720
Xiao Zhuang,

30
00:04:36,639 --> 00:04:38,680
I always treated you like a brother.

31
00:04:41,959 --> 00:04:43,079
You betrayed me.

32
00:04:44,120 --> 00:04:45,360
I'm a cop.

33
00:05:26,600 --> 00:05:27,319
Watch out!

34
00:05:46,920 --> 00:05:47,399
I'm fine.

35
00:05:49,199 --> 00:05:51,959
I'm just... I'm just a bit dizzy.

36
00:05:58,879 --> 00:05:59,519
Michael.

37
00:06:01,480 --> 00:06:02,079
Actually,

38
00:06:04,519 --> 00:06:07,199
even though I'm a cop,

39
00:06:08,519 --> 00:06:12,519
I've never worn a police uniform.

40
00:06:16,360 --> 00:06:17,079
Tell me,

41
00:06:18,199 --> 00:06:20,040
am I a cop right now?

42
00:06:20,600 --> 00:06:21,360
You are.

43
00:06:35,720 --> 00:06:37,000
Tell me,

44
00:06:38,079 --> 00:06:43,680
will I look as sharp as you in uniform?

45
00:06:59,560 --> 00:07:00,199
Candy.

46
00:07:01,560 --> 00:07:01,959
Candy.

47
00:07:06,800 --> 00:07:07,360
Candy.

48
00:08:43,679 --> 00:08:44,480
Ms. Li Siqi.

49
00:08:47,080 --> 00:08:47,919
Ms. Li Siqi.

50
00:08:48,720 --> 00:08:49,919
We suspect you of drug trafficking

51
00:08:49,960 --> 00:08:51,000
and international money laundering.

52
00:08:51,679 --> 00:08:52,679
Please come with us.

53
00:08:55,000 --> 00:08:55,399
All right.

54
00:08:56,120 --> 00:08:57,399
Can I make a call first?

55
00:08:58,600 --> 00:08:59,879
I don't think that call you want to make

56
00:09:00,320 --> 00:09:01,519
will be answered.

57
00:09:55,360 --> 00:09:56,159
Mr. Theerade,

58
00:09:57,240 --> 00:09:58,200
it's been taken care of.

59
00:10:00,080 --> 00:10:01,440
All right. Understood.

60
00:10:16,320 --> 00:10:19,200
Theerade and Long Zhiyuan joined forces.

61
00:10:24,679 --> 00:10:28,639
The Jiechan Gang's power will reshuffle.

62
00:12:00,840 --> 00:12:02,559
Mr. Theerade, welcome, welcome.

63
00:12:03,399 --> 00:12:03,960
Mr. Long.

64
00:12:04,440 --> 00:12:05,960
Getting to see your territory today

65
00:12:06,480 --> 00:12:07,799
has truly been an eye-opener.

66
00:12:08,159 --> 00:12:09,120
Before long,

67
00:12:09,440 --> 00:12:11,600
the entire Jiechan Gang will be ours.

68
00:12:12,519 --> 00:12:14,960
We've got the money, guns, and men.

69
00:12:15,159 --> 00:12:16,240
Those four old bastards

70
00:12:16,320 --> 00:12:17,759
will step down sooner or later.

71
00:12:18,960 --> 00:12:20,399
I invited everyone for drinks today.

72
00:12:20,759 --> 00:12:23,279
We can deal with the killing later.

73
00:12:23,399 --> 00:12:25,720
Let's not spoil Mr. Theerade's mood.

74
00:12:26,720 --> 00:12:28,399
I think Mr. Dong is absolutely right.

75
00:12:28,759 --> 00:12:29,720
Those four old geezers

76
00:12:30,039 --> 00:12:31,120
should've died a long time ago.

77
00:12:32,120 --> 00:12:32,919
Yes, exactly.

78
00:12:33,120 --> 00:12:34,080
Please, right this way.

79
00:12:52,000 --> 00:12:52,559
Let me introduce everyone.

80
00:12:53,600 --> 00:12:54,759
Undercover officer Wei Kai.

81
00:12:55,200 --> 00:12:56,639
Comrade Zhuang Yan, Comrade Ge Dan.

82
00:12:56,879 --> 00:12:57,440
Comrade Zhuang Yan.

83
00:12:57,679 --> 00:12:58,600
Hello, Comrade Wei Kai.

84
00:12:58,879 --> 00:12:59,519
Comrade Ge Dan.

85
00:12:59,639 --> 00:13:00,600
Hello, Comrade Wei Kai.

86
00:13:02,000 --> 00:13:04,159
Everyone's here. Give us the report.

87
00:13:04,399 --> 00:13:06,080
Captain Bai, I saw Li Xiao.

88
00:13:06,240 --> 00:13:07,879
He and Tian Xin were captured by Piyazi.

89
00:13:07,960 --> 00:13:08,759
How are they?

90
00:13:09,240 --> 00:13:10,039
Are they in danger?

91
00:13:12,159 --> 00:13:13,000
Not for now.

92
00:13:13,360 --> 00:13:14,639
But it's hard to say if this drags on.

93
00:13:14,960 --> 00:13:16,480
I fear Long Zhiyuan may change his mind.

94
00:13:17,679 --> 00:13:18,559
As long as they're alive.

95
00:13:20,039 --> 00:13:21,919
On the surface, Long works with Theerade,

96
00:13:22,159 --> 00:13:23,159
but behind his back,

97
00:13:23,600 --> 00:13:24,879
he's been developing his own market.

98
00:13:25,799 --> 00:13:26,879
After arriving in Country M,

99
00:13:26,960 --> 00:13:28,679
he first upgraded Piyazi's base,

100
00:13:28,840 --> 00:13:30,200
then set up secret warehouses.

101
00:13:30,399 --> 00:13:31,960
He's using his warehouses in Country M

102
00:13:31,960 --> 00:13:32,879
and logistics companies

103
00:13:32,879 --> 00:13:34,000
to ship out massive quantities.

104
00:13:34,000 --> 00:13:35,120
Theerade doesn't know about this.

105
00:13:35,399 --> 00:13:36,600
If Theerade finds out,

106
00:13:36,799 --> 00:13:38,240
they'll definitely tear each other apart.

107
00:13:38,519 --> 00:13:39,600
From what you're saying,

108
00:13:39,799 --> 00:13:40,799
arresting Long Zhiyuan

109
00:13:40,919 --> 00:13:42,480
requires Country M's police support.

110
00:13:43,159 --> 00:13:43,639
Yes.

111
00:13:44,879 --> 00:13:46,559
But after the base was upgraded,

112
00:13:46,799 --> 00:13:48,679
their armed forces remain unclear to us.

113
00:13:49,799 --> 00:13:51,919
I'll report this to higher-ups

114
00:13:52,120 --> 00:13:53,919
to quickly devise an action plan.

115
00:13:54,519 --> 00:13:55,279
Also, Wei Kai,

116
00:13:55,679 --> 00:13:56,720
before the joint operation,

117
00:13:57,039 --> 00:13:58,960
I need a military map of Piyazi's base.

118
00:14:00,559 --> 00:14:01,480
That shouldn't be a problem.

119
00:14:01,639 --> 00:14:02,240
Also,

120
00:14:04,080 --> 00:14:05,279
please do your best to ensure

121
00:14:05,360 --> 00:14:07,559
Li Xiao and Tian Xin's safety, okay?

122
00:14:09,559 --> 00:14:10,039
Here's what we'll do:

123
00:14:10,519 --> 00:14:13,159
I'll urge Interpol to act ASAP.

124
00:14:13,879 --> 00:14:14,399
Alright.

125
00:14:15,759 --> 00:14:16,679
Is there any other news?

126
00:14:17,639 --> 00:14:19,159
The Four Great Families found out

127
00:14:19,159 --> 00:14:20,200
Theerade is trafficking drugs to China.

128
00:14:20,320 --> 00:14:21,320
They're demanding that Theerade

129
00:14:21,320 --> 00:14:22,799
give up a 30% share in the drug business.

130
00:14:23,480 --> 00:14:25,039
Long Zhiyuan and his men agreed to it.

131
00:14:25,960 --> 00:14:27,120
They invited The Four Great Families

132
00:14:27,159 --> 00:14:28,799
to negotiate at the drug lab in 3 days.

133
00:14:28,799 --> 00:14:30,600
Long Zhiyuan brought in many extra men,

134
00:14:31,000 --> 00:14:32,120
so I think they're planning

135
00:14:32,120 --> 00:14:33,039
to take out The Four Great Families

136
00:14:33,039 --> 00:14:33,799
all in one fell swoop.

137
00:14:37,320 --> 00:14:38,799
I suspect Long Zhiyuan's target

138
00:14:39,840 --> 00:14:41,360
isn't just The Four Great Families.

139
00:14:41,399 --> 00:14:42,360
It can't be that simple.

140
00:14:56,200 --> 00:14:58,200
I am truly disappointed.

141
00:14:58,279 --> 00:14:59,360
This isn't over yet.

142
00:14:59,879 --> 00:15:01,519
This is utterly intolerable.

143
00:15:01,840 --> 00:15:02,440
You know what?

144
00:15:02,440 --> 00:15:03,919
We need to take a stand.

145
00:15:03,919 --> 00:15:05,159
Tell him that what he's doing

146
00:15:05,159 --> 00:15:06,440
is simply unacceptable.

147
00:15:06,440 --> 00:15:07,240
That's right.

148
00:15:07,240 --> 00:15:09,720
We have to teach them a lesson.

149
00:15:09,720 --> 00:15:11,600
Yes, exactly.

150
00:15:16,840 --> 00:15:17,720
Sorry,

151
00:15:18,200 --> 00:15:18,879
I'm late.

152
00:15:21,879 --> 00:15:24,679
Mr. Theerade breached the agreement first,

153
00:15:24,919 --> 00:15:26,120
but we won't hold it against you.

154
00:15:26,639 --> 00:15:29,919
A 30% share is our bottom line.

155
00:15:30,879 --> 00:15:33,360
Back then, your father, Jessadaporn,

156
00:15:33,480 --> 00:15:37,360
also paid our Four Great Families a share.

157
00:15:37,720 --> 00:15:39,600
I believe Mr. Theerade

158
00:15:39,600 --> 00:15:41,039
will also be glad to do so.

159
00:15:41,159 --> 00:15:44,279
Trading a 30% share for lifelong peace...

160
00:15:44,440 --> 00:15:45,759
In fact, this deal

161
00:15:45,919 --> 00:15:47,000
is quite a bargain for Mr. Theerade.

162
00:15:49,600 --> 00:15:51,279
The elders are absolutely right.

163
00:15:52,200 --> 00:15:53,559
This 30% share,

164
00:15:53,559 --> 00:15:55,240
I, Theerade, am willing to give it up.

165
00:15:55,519 --> 00:15:57,159
Just consider it

166
00:15:58,159 --> 00:15:59,879
to cover the elders'

167
00:16:07,440 --> 00:16:08,480
funeral expenses.

168
00:16:12,799 --> 00:16:13,840
What do you think you're doing?!

169
00:16:37,279 --> 00:16:39,080
I've waited for this day for a long time.

170
00:16:46,200 --> 00:16:49,279
Cheng Fei sends regards to Jessadaporn.

171
00:17:00,679 --> 00:17:01,600
I told you

172
00:17:02,320 --> 00:17:04,880
that one day you would become Theerade.

173
00:17:06,119 --> 00:17:08,799
Now you're one step closer to that day.

174
00:17:08,839 --> 00:17:11,359
Do you mean the Theerade of the past,

175
00:17:13,279 --> 00:17:14,480
or the one now?

176
00:17:15,680 --> 00:17:17,079
He and I are bitter enemies.

177
00:17:17,640 --> 00:17:19,519
He must die. Justice demands it.

178
00:17:20,920 --> 00:17:22,000
You're different.

179
00:17:22,880 --> 00:17:23,960
We're brothers.

180
00:17:24,759 --> 00:17:25,880
Brothers for life.

181
00:17:42,359 --> 00:17:44,759
We've partnered with Country M's police

182
00:17:44,759 --> 00:17:46,599
and approved the arrest of Long Zhiyuan

183
00:17:46,759 --> 00:17:49,359
and the former Theerade syndicate.

184
00:17:49,559 --> 00:17:51,400
I will act as the general commander.

185
00:17:51,599 --> 00:17:52,319
Comrade Bai Hua,

186
00:17:52,799 --> 00:17:54,319
you will be the primary on-site commander.

187
00:17:55,519 --> 00:17:57,039
Captain Bai, do you have any questions?

188
00:17:59,559 --> 00:18:00,799
A new situation has arisen

189
00:18:01,039 --> 00:18:02,559
that I must report to leadership.

190
00:18:04,359 --> 00:18:06,319
Our operation to capture Long Zhiyuan

191
00:18:06,519 --> 00:18:08,359
was initially set for the day of the deal

192
00:18:08,400 --> 00:18:09,359
with our undercover officer.

193
00:18:10,000 --> 00:18:11,519
However, I just received intel

194
00:18:12,000 --> 00:18:13,119
that three days ago,

195
00:18:13,839 --> 00:18:17,279
Long Zhiyuan sent men to take Li and Tian

196
00:18:17,680 --> 00:18:20,039
to Piyazi's base to hold them.

197
00:18:20,440 --> 00:18:21,839
To ensure the hostages' safety,

198
00:18:21,960 --> 00:18:24,799
I request that on the day before the deal,

199
00:18:25,240 --> 00:18:28,240
we rescue Li Xiao and Tian Xin

200
00:18:28,400 --> 00:18:29,880
and apprehend Long Zhiyuan.

201
00:18:32,160 --> 00:18:35,119
It seems Long Zhiyuan detained them

202
00:18:35,319 --> 00:18:36,519
specifically so that

203
00:18:37,039 --> 00:18:38,599
during a confrontation with police,

204
00:18:38,799 --> 00:18:41,319
he could use them as hostages against us.

205
00:18:44,400 --> 00:18:45,000
Director Huang,

206
00:18:46,000 --> 00:18:47,319
Li Xiao is your family.

207
00:18:47,400 --> 00:18:48,720
Let's hear your thoughts.

208
00:18:53,319 --> 00:18:54,319
I have no objections.

209
00:18:54,640 --> 00:18:56,079
Li Xiao is my nephew,

210
00:18:56,240 --> 00:18:57,400
but even more so, our comrade-in-arms.

211
00:18:58,079 --> 00:19:00,720
Tian Xin is my comrade's daughter,

212
00:19:00,799 --> 00:19:01,880
a citizen under our protection.

213
00:19:02,799 --> 00:19:04,720
Protecting our comrades and our citizens

214
00:19:04,720 --> 00:19:06,480
is our bounden duty.

215
00:19:06,960 --> 00:19:08,039
Personal feelings

216
00:19:08,160 --> 00:19:08,960
will never compromise

217
00:19:09,079 --> 00:19:10,960
my judgment in operational command.

218
00:19:16,039 --> 00:19:18,960
We will show no leniency to criminals!

219
00:19:40,359 --> 00:19:43,440
In the joint Operation Thunderbolt,

220
00:19:43,440 --> 00:19:45,480
police from China and Country M

221
00:19:45,480 --> 00:19:47,200
dispatched special task forces,

222
00:19:47,200 --> 00:19:49,599
which at 6:00 a.m. on December 17,

223
00:19:49,720 --> 00:19:52,640
raided Long Zhiyuan's border drug lab

224
00:19:52,640 --> 00:19:55,119
and the cartel on Country M's border

225
00:19:55,119 --> 00:19:57,839
guarding the poppy plantations,

226
00:19:57,839 --> 00:19:59,839
in simultaneous raids.

227
00:20:33,720 --> 00:20:35,599
Officer Wei Kai, Nanhai Anti-Drug Squad,

228
00:20:35,599 --> 00:20:37,279
badge number 065232,

229
00:20:37,359 --> 00:20:38,200
reporting for rendezvous as ordered.

230
00:20:38,400 --> 00:20:40,000
Brief everyone on the mission route again.

231
00:20:40,000 --> 00:20:40,480
Yes, sir.

232
00:20:47,759 --> 00:20:48,759
Long Zhiyuan and Piyazi

233
00:20:48,920 --> 00:20:51,079
are northeast of the base's center.

234
00:20:51,319 --> 00:20:52,799
Li Xiao and Tian Xin are held

235
00:20:52,880 --> 00:20:54,759
in a second-floor cell, southwest side.

236
00:20:55,079 --> 00:20:56,799
Five thugs are on the first floor,

237
00:20:57,000 --> 00:20:58,279
with two guarding the second floor.

238
00:20:58,359 --> 00:20:59,440
Shifts rotate every four hours.

239
00:20:59,839 --> 00:21:01,559
In every building across the base,

240
00:21:01,759 --> 00:21:03,319
cameras cover all entrances and halls.

241
00:21:04,440 --> 00:21:05,519
At 6:15, Zhuang Yan will

242
00:21:05,519 --> 00:21:06,599
infiltrate the main surveillance system.

243
00:21:06,799 --> 00:21:09,039
We have 15 minutes to bypass surveillance

244
00:21:09,079 --> 00:21:10,200
and rescue Li Xiao and Tian Xin.

245
00:23:06,039 --> 00:23:06,880
What's wrong?

246
00:23:08,079 --> 00:23:09,039
Nothing.

247
00:23:48,279 --> 00:23:50,200
Long Zhiyuan always saw you as his own.

248
00:23:50,759 --> 00:23:52,839
I'd have killed you if he didn't stop me.

249
00:23:52,880 --> 00:23:55,920
Now I need no excuse to kill you.

250
00:23:57,759 --> 00:24:01,359
Xiaoyi, I'm a cop. He's a drug dealer.

251
00:24:02,079 --> 00:24:03,279
We don't walk the same path.

252
00:24:03,400 --> 00:24:04,200
Shut up!

253
00:24:05,680 --> 00:24:06,200
Xiaoyi.

254
00:24:07,319 --> 00:24:08,200
In ten minutes,

255
00:24:08,640 --> 00:24:10,359
the joint operation will begin.

256
00:24:11,000 --> 00:24:12,200
You have no way out.

257
00:24:12,680 --> 00:24:13,480
As long as you're willing,

258
00:24:13,920 --> 00:24:15,160
you can turn back at any time.

259
00:24:30,759 --> 00:24:31,200
Stand by.

260
00:24:33,000 --> 00:24:33,440
Move!

261
00:24:33,880 --> 00:24:34,359
Copy that.

262
00:24:35,079 --> 00:24:35,599
Let's move.

263
00:24:41,920 --> 00:24:42,519
Tian Xin!

264
00:24:43,200 --> 00:24:43,680
Tian Xin!

265
00:24:45,119 --> 00:24:46,279
Don't be scared. I'm here to save you.

266
00:24:46,880 --> 00:24:47,400
Li Xiao!

267
00:24:48,160 --> 00:24:48,799
Li Xiao!

268
00:24:51,799 --> 00:24:52,200
Hurry!

269
00:25:00,039 --> 00:25:00,640
Li Xiao!

270
00:25:06,839 --> 00:25:07,400
Get out of here!

271
00:25:08,400 --> 00:25:08,960
Give me a gun.

272
00:25:31,359 --> 00:25:31,839
Let's go.

273
00:25:46,119 --> 00:25:46,720
Take your positions.

274
00:25:47,079 --> 00:25:47,559
Yes, sir.

275
00:25:54,480 --> 00:25:55,039
Fire!

276
00:26:16,680 --> 00:26:17,400
Hurry!

277
00:26:39,240 --> 00:26:39,680
Take them out!

278
00:27:11,960 --> 00:27:12,680
Cover me!

279
00:28:02,880 --> 00:28:03,799
Come on!

280
00:28:50,759 --> 00:28:51,599
Come on!

281
00:29:03,440 --> 00:29:04,119
Freeze!

282
00:29:06,400 --> 00:29:06,799
Take him away.

283
00:29:07,359 --> 00:29:08,240
Get back!

284
00:29:08,960 --> 00:29:10,000
Get back!

285
00:30:34,079 --> 00:30:35,640
Make sure to bring them both home safely.

286
00:30:39,240 --> 00:30:40,119
Stay safe.

287
00:30:42,400 --> 00:30:42,880
Let's move.

288
00:31:04,559 --> 00:31:05,160
Stay here and keep watch.

289
00:31:05,319 --> 00:31:05,720
Let's go.

290
00:31:41,920 --> 00:31:43,319
Captain, mission accomplished.

291
00:31:45,599 --> 00:31:46,200
Are you okay?

292
00:31:49,519 --> 00:31:50,359
Escort them back.

293
00:31:50,480 --> 00:31:50,880
Yes, sir.

294
00:32:00,599 --> 00:32:01,160
Li Xiao.

295
00:32:06,359 --> 00:32:07,039
Don't worry.

296
00:32:12,279 --> 00:32:14,000
Captain Bai, Li Xiao reporting back.

297
00:32:17,680 --> 00:32:18,119
Move out.

298
00:32:48,039 --> 00:32:49,480
Commander, target location confirmed.

299
00:32:49,519 --> 00:32:50,640
Move, move, move!

300
00:32:56,000 --> 00:32:57,960
Long Zhiyuan is fleeing northwest.

301
00:32:58,200 --> 00:32:59,039
Zhuang Yan is in pursuit.

302
00:32:59,519 --> 00:33:01,359
Captain Bai, rendezvous with Zhuang Yan.

303
00:33:01,799 --> 00:33:02,200
Copy that.

304
00:33:03,000 --> 00:33:03,440
Destroy it.

305
00:33:03,920 --> 00:33:04,240
Fall back!

306
00:33:04,319 --> 00:33:04,720
Yes, sir!

307
00:33:23,279 --> 00:33:23,920
Zhuang Cen.

308
00:33:24,519 --> 00:33:25,440
I treated you like a brother,

309
00:33:25,839 --> 00:33:26,920
yet you betrayed me.

310
00:33:27,279 --> 00:33:28,119
Long Zhiyuan.

311
00:33:28,559 --> 00:33:29,359
I'm a cop.

312
00:33:29,880 --> 00:33:30,759
Have you ever thought...

313
00:33:31,160 --> 00:33:32,079
what I can give you...

314
00:33:32,279 --> 00:33:34,000
is what you'd never get in a lifetime as a cop?

315
00:33:34,200 --> 00:33:35,079
As a cop,

316
00:33:35,240 --> 00:33:36,920
I have things you'll never get in life.

317
00:33:37,240 --> 00:33:38,880
Dignity. Honor.

318
00:33:39,759 --> 00:33:40,759
It's not over yet.

319
00:33:41,359 --> 00:33:42,200
It's anyone's game.

320
00:33:42,480 --> 00:33:43,359
Let's see who dies first.

321
00:33:47,599 --> 00:33:48,200
Come with me.

322
00:33:52,799 --> 00:33:54,480
Captain Bai, they're escaping by plane!

323
00:33:55,359 --> 00:33:57,000
Captain Lu, intercept them from the air!

324
00:34:11,679 --> 00:34:12,320
You guys hold this position.

325
00:34:48,239 --> 00:34:48,960
Get down!

326
00:35:13,679 --> 00:35:14,440
Captain Bai!

327
00:35:20,559 --> 00:35:21,199
Over here!

328
00:35:21,880 --> 00:35:22,559
This way!

329
00:35:26,079 --> 00:35:28,119
Long Zhiyuan is escaping by helicopter!

330
00:35:28,360 --> 00:35:30,079
Zhuang Yan, arrest Long on the roof now!

331
00:35:30,280 --> 00:35:31,280
Lu Wei, intercept from the air!

332
00:35:31,280 --> 00:35:32,440
Don't let Long Zhiyuan escape!

333
00:35:40,559 --> 00:35:41,239
Get down!

334
00:36:58,239 --> 00:36:59,239
Reporting, Commander.

335
00:37:00,280 --> 00:37:00,800
Captain Bai...

336
00:37:04,320 --> 00:37:05,360
Captain Bai was killed in action.

337
00:37:47,800 --> 00:37:48,719
Fighting violence with violence

338
00:37:49,800 --> 00:37:51,079
is not what justice is about.

339
00:37:52,679 --> 00:37:54,199
A true police officer

340
00:37:55,000 --> 00:37:56,880
must bring criminals to justice,

341
00:37:57,840 --> 00:37:59,280
not take the law into their own hands

342
00:38:00,159 --> 00:38:01,159
to mete out punishment.

343
00:38:01,800 --> 00:38:02,400
Zhuang Yan,

344
00:38:03,719 --> 00:38:05,159
I trust someone as capable as you

345
00:38:05,800 --> 00:38:07,280
will, in future operations,

346
00:38:08,599 --> 00:38:09,679
know where to draw the line.

347
00:39:57,360 --> 00:39:59,599
Another close comrade has left us.

348
00:40:00,679 --> 00:40:03,960
All our officers are here to see you off.

349
00:40:29,559 --> 00:40:30,840
It's finally time to close the net.

350
00:40:31,599 --> 00:40:32,440
Yeah.

351
00:40:33,360 --> 00:40:34,800
We've waited so long for this day.

352
00:40:45,400 --> 00:40:46,320
We're back.

353
00:40:47,440 --> 00:40:49,719
But Captain Bai remains where she fought.

354
00:40:51,360 --> 00:40:52,119
She's still here.

355
00:40:54,400 --> 00:40:56,440
She'll always be by our side.

356
00:41:02,960 --> 00:41:03,800
Done venting?

357
00:41:14,599 --> 00:41:15,719
Just like you,

358
00:41:17,519 --> 00:41:20,079
we know the only way to save Tian Xin now

359
00:41:20,280 --> 00:41:21,599
is to capture Li Qiang.

360
00:41:23,239 --> 00:41:24,280
I also believe

361
00:41:25,039 --> 00:41:26,280
that right now,

362
00:41:26,719 --> 00:41:27,960
Tian Xin is pinning

363
00:41:28,079 --> 00:41:29,480
all her hopes on you.

364
00:41:30,599 --> 00:41:31,920
If you don't want to let her down,

365
00:41:32,760 --> 00:41:33,599
take a shower,

366
00:41:34,079 --> 00:41:35,079
clean yourself up,

367
00:41:35,400 --> 00:41:36,519
and return to the unit for the briefing.

368
00:41:41,840 --> 00:41:43,239
Those who once protected us

369
00:41:44,800 --> 00:41:46,199
will always stay by our side.

370
00:41:47,840 --> 00:41:48,840
And their spirits

371
00:41:51,000 --> 00:41:52,480
continue to guard this land.

372
00:41:53,079 --> 00:41:54,559
I understand the danger of this mission.

373
00:41:55,800 --> 00:41:56,239
Furthermore,

374
00:41:56,679 --> 00:41:57,519
please believe in me.

375
00:41:57,719 --> 00:41:59,320
I'm not the Zhuang Yan I used to be.

376
00:42:00,440 --> 00:42:01,599
I believe in myself, too.

377
00:42:03,280 --> 00:42:04,920
I will complete the mission successfully.

378
00:42:10,920 --> 00:42:12,400
I have only one order for you.

379
00:42:14,199 --> 00:42:15,559
No matter what happens,

380
00:42:17,360 --> 00:42:18,199
come back alive.

381
00:42:26,039 --> 00:42:29,039
Our fight against drug dealers continues.

382
00:42:30,559 --> 00:42:31,599
Until total victory is won,

383
00:42:32,519 --> 00:42:33,519
we will never rest!

384
00:42:33,719 --> 00:42:34,719
Salute!

385
00:42:48,800 --> 00:42:50,440
I am a People's Police officer of China.

386
00:42:51,079 --> 00:42:51,960
I solemnly swear to:

387
00:42:52,880 --> 00:42:55,719
uphold the absolute leadership of the CPC,

388
00:42:56,440 --> 00:42:59,320
dedicate myself to public security,

389
00:43:00,280 --> 00:43:01,480
be loyal to the Party,

390
00:43:01,840 --> 00:43:02,800
serve the people,

391
00:43:03,199 --> 00:43:04,320
enforce the law impartially,

392
00:43:04,719 --> 00:43:05,639
maintain strict discipline,

393
00:43:06,519 --> 00:43:08,079
and fight to defend political security,

394
00:43:08,440 --> 00:43:09,760
maintain social stability,

395
00:43:10,199 --> 00:43:13,440
and protect the people's peace!
